{
  "name": "BioClima OGC Building Blocks",
  "abstract": "Register of OGC Building Blocks for Essential Biodiversity Variables (EBVs),\nderived indicators, bioclimatic zonification, data provenance and policy\nalignment with the Kunming-Montreal GBF. The pilot dataset is the Start of\nVegetation Active Period in Finland (2001-2018).\n",
  "description": "This register defines BioClima-specific building blocks on top of the\nOGC CoverageJSON community standard. It includes:\n\n- A profile of CoverageJSON for BioClima EBV datasets.\n- Generic schemas for EBV records and indicator records.\n- Concrete EBV datasets for Finnish coniferous and deciduous vegetation.\n- The Phenological Change Indicator (PCI) and its bioclimatic zonification,\n  each with a Python implementation that the CI can re-run automatically.\n- W3C PROV-O provenance schemas for both EBVs and indicators.\n- Policy alignment schemas linking indicators to Kunming-Montreal GBF\n  targets and SDG 15.\n\nA multilingual SKOS ontology (English, Spanish, Chinese, Romanian) lives\noutside the register at /ontology and is referenced from every block by\nIRI.\n",
  "modified": "2026-05-15T13:41:55.246555",
  "tooling": {
    "bblocks-postprocess": {
      "commitId": "\"6b01f188cc614cc2e65f4bf86a2623f98f101dfd",
